* Caller with inline DEFINE SUBROUTINE (no params) AND a PERFORM target
* Also an external MY-SUB.NSS exists (with params) to prove inline wins (FR-12)
* Feature 17, T4a, Story 2 AC1/AC2/AC4
PROGRAM PERFCALLER

DEFINE DATA
  LOCAL
    1 #X (N4)
  END
END

DEFINE SUBROUTINE MY-SUB
  WRITE 'Inline subroutine'
END-SUBROUTINE

PERFORM MY-SUB

END
